# kiri doctor

kiri [version]: what it found out about the terminal, and the settings it uses. Written to a file, this report stays Markdown, ready to paste into a bug report.

## Terminal

| What | Found |
|---|---|
| Terminal | none |
| Window | unknown |
| Cell size | unknown; images take 10 × 20 pixels |
| Graphics | no |
| Text sizing | no |
| Colours | none |
| Background | unknown |
| Hyperlinks | no |
| Underline styles | no |

## Settings

| Setting | Value | From |
|---|---|---|
| Mode | auto | default |
| Theme | built-in | default |
| Margins | on | default |
| Images | on | default |
| Largest image | 10 MB | default |
| Width | 80 cells | default |

## Files

| File | Path | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Configuration file | `~/.config/kiri/config.toml` | not found |
| Theme file | `~/.config/kiri/theme.toml` | not found |

